---
title: "Anatomy and Positioning of the Breast"
code: "RAD-233"
category: "radiography"
credits: "1"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
prerequisiteNote: "Prerequisite: ARRT or eligible"
---

Presents the risk factors for breast disease, anatomy and physiology of the breast and discusses the various pathologies identified through mammography. Includes routine and special projections of the breast. Lecture 1 hour per week. Additional course fee applies.
